{
  "$comment": [
    "Deliberately incomplete. Fallback is per key, not per locale: what is missing here",
    "renders in English while everything present renders in Arabic, rather than the page",
    "reverting wholesale. `npm run verify` counts the untranslated keys and fails only on a",
    "key that exists here and not in en.json.",
    "",
    "What this bundle is really for: `dir` becomes rtl from a computed signal, the logical",
    "Tailwind utilities (ms-, me-, ps-, pe-) flip the whole layout with no per-locale",
    "stylesheet, and the plural categories below are zero/one/two/few/many/other — six forms",
    "for the same key English answers with two, at no extra cost to any caller."
